>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Say Goodbye to Pesky Cockroaches with Effective Pest Control<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ab0f78 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6ab0f78\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de434cf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"de434cf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>We don\u2019t usually attribute much importance to cockroaches in our property. But cockroaches are a high-risk pest to have at your home or office. They carry a wide range of serious illnesses, including dysentery, food poisoning, typhoid, etc. Moreover, cockroaches are the carriers of some major allergens.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08bd23f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"08bd23f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><p>They are often the cause of asthma, eczema and other serious forms of skin allergies. The health risk associated with cockroaches is particularly high in homes with children, the elderly or those recuperating from illnesses.\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"><strong>7 States Pest Control<\/strong><\/a>\u00a0offers you with effective\u00a0<strong>cockroach control<\/strong>\u00a0and elimination services. Contact us to know more about our cockroach pest control services.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elemento